&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Define the product strategy and execution for Zscaler Cyber Security to ensure alignment with customer needs and the evolving market landscape&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
