&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;8+ years of product management experience with deep expertise and comprehensive market knowledge in cybersecurity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
