&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re in an unbelievably exciting area of tech and are fundamentally reshaping the data storage industry. Here, you lead with innovative thinking, grow along with us, and join the smartest team in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive the narrative of the Everpure Platform and Enterprise Data Cloud (EDC) to redefine how organizations manage data at scale. You will partner with Product Management and Global Field teams to bridge the gap between complex engineering and customer value. By unifying storage and automation into a single operating environment, you will empower customers to simplify their infrastructure across on-premises and AI environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect Messaging and Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the development of high-impact positioning and go-to-market strategies for the Everpure Platform, ensuring a cohesive narrative that aligns with the broader Enterprise Data Cloud vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execute Global Product Launches: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the end-to-end creation of core GTM content—including technical white papers, executive presentations, and web narratives—that drives platform awareness and moves the needle on product adoption KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate Field Success:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and deliver comprehensive enablement programs and tools that equip global sales and partner teams to effectively communicate Everpure’s unique value proposition to enterprise IT personas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence Product Evolution:&lt;/strong&gt; Synthesize market trends and competitive intelligence into actionable insights for Product Management, shaping the platform&#39;s future to meet emerging customer infrastructure and management needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Marketing Background: &lt;/strong&gt;A history of successfully owning, launching, and marketing technology products, preferably to Enterprise IT customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Storytelling:&lt;/strong&gt; A mastery of translating complex technical features into compelling business outcomes, with a proven ability to craft narratives that resonate with enterprise-level IT decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Infrastructure Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep professional knowledge of data storage, management solutions, or cloud infrastructure, allowing you to act as a credible subject matter expert for internal stakeholders and external customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional ability to build consensus and drive alignment across cross-functional teams, including engineering and sales, to execute complex go-to-market initiatives in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;We are primarily an in-office environment and therefore, you will be expected to work from the Santa Clara, CA or Seattle / Bellevue, WA office in compliance with Everpure’s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-ONSITE #LI-KQ1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Salary ranges are determined based on role, level and location. For positions open to candidates in multiple geographical locations, the base salary range is reflective of the labor market across the applicable locations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role may be eligible for incentive pay and/or equity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;There is no application deadline and we accept applications on an ongoing basis until the job is filled.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual base salary range is: &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$182,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$273,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://purebenefits.com&quot;&gt;purebenefits.com&lt;/a&gt; for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:TA-Ops@purestorage.com&quot;&gt;TA-Ops@purestorage.com&lt;/a&gt; if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re in an unbelievably exciting area of tech and are fundamentally reshaping the data storage industry. Here, you lead with innovative thinking, grow along with us, and join the smartest team in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Employee Relations (ER) Business Partner&lt;/strong&gt; to join Everpure in the UK or Czech Republic, a fast-paced, exciting, and genuinely great place to work where no two days are the same. This is an opportunity to join a thriving company and play a key role in supporting managers, HRBPs, and leaders on complex employee relations matters across a dynamic, high-growth environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will bring strong EMEA Employee Relations experience, sound employment law knowledge, excellent investigation skills, and the ability to handle sensitive situations with confidence, discretion, and balanced judgment. You will manage complex ER cases across multiple jurisdictions, conduct fair and thorough reviews, advise on risk, and help leaders navigate people matters in a way that is practical, consistent, and commercially sound.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who is energized by variety, comfortable in a fast-paced environment, and excited by the opportunity to learn and grow in a role that offers both challenge and impact. Everpure is the kind of company where you can build, influence, and develop, all while being part of a smart, collaborative, and forward-thinking team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end workplace investigations, including witness interviews, fact-finding, documentation review, and outcome recommendations, ensuring matters are handled promptly, fairly, and consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply a strong understanding of ER case methodology in day-to-day management, including case intake, risk assessment, and case closure, while maintaining accurate and timely updates in the case management tool.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate a high level of attention to detail by maintaining accurate documentation and producing clear, thorough, and defensible written reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple complex cases and changing demands with resilience and balanced, unbiased judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide expert advice and guidance to managers, HRBPs, and business leaders on employee relations matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess risk and recommend appropriate actions in line with company policy, employment law, and industry best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify themes and trends using metrics and data analytics; provide recommendations to improve manager capability, employee experience, and organizational effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development and implementation of ER processes, policies, templates, and guidance materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver coaching and training to managers and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain confidentiality and handle sensitive matters with discretion, sound judgment, and professionalism.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support change initiatives and organizational decisions where ER expertise is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are primarily an in-office environment and therefore, you will be expected to work from the Staines, UK or&amp;nbsp;Prague, CZ office in compliance with Everpure&#39;s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Years of dedicated Employee Relations / Workplace Investigation experience&lt;/strong&gt; in fast-paced, matrixed, and international (EMEA-focused) organisations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong knowledge of EMEA employment law and ER best practices&lt;/strong&gt;, with a track record of independently managing complex, multi-jurisdictional cases from intake to resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced investigation skills&lt;/strong&gt;, including structured interviewing, note-taking, evidence assessment, and clear, well-reasoned report and outcome writing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven ability to build trust and influence&lt;/strong&gt;, working closely with senior leaders, HR, Legal, works councils, and other employee representative bodies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Confident decision-making&lt;/strong&gt;, balancing legal, reputational, and people considerations to reach practical, well-justified outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insight- and data-led approach&lt;/strong&gt;, using case trends to drive prevention, manager education, and broader ER strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resilience and adaptability&lt;/strong&gt;, comfortable with ambiguity, sensitive matters, and competing priorities in high-growth, evolving environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic ER mindset&lt;/strong&gt;, able to move beyond case management to design and embed proactive ER practices across international/EMEA populations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional HR/ER accreditation&lt;/strong&gt;, such as CIPD or an equivalent certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-ONSITE&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
