&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;AvePoint is hiring a&amp;nbsp;Revenue Operations&amp;nbsp;GTM Engineer to design and build the underlying technical infrastructure that powers our revenue engine across&amp;nbsp;departments,&amp;nbsp;including&amp;nbsp;Sales, Marketing, Product, and Customer Success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role sits within Revenue Operations&amp;nbsp;(RevOps)&amp;nbsp;and treats&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Go-To-Market execution as an engineered system&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;— not a manual process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will architect the automation layer that connects our CRM, marketing platforms, product telemetry, support systems, and financial workflows into a scalable, real-time operating environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
